          "id": 3552172446,
          "type": null,
          "body": "cppcheck reports 2 of these (not the packet-procmon.c one), and many others (I've been fixing some of these after running commands like './tools/check_dissector.py --commits 10' to look for issues among recent commits).\n\n.\n\n epan/dissectors/packet-http3.c:1769:21: warning: Variable 'datalen' is assigned a value that is never used. \\[unreadVariable\\] datalen = decompressed_length;\n\nepan/dissectors/packet-tcpcl.c:1359:18: warning: Variable 'sub_item' is assigned a value that is never used. \\[unreadVariable\\] sub_item = proto_tree_add_item_ret_varint(conv_tree, hf_tcpclv3_ack_length, tvb, offset, -1, ENC_VARINT_SDNV, &segment_length, &sdnv_length);",
